ence/logging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/logging#why-stderr","content":"terrably uses pino to emit newline-delimited JSON in the go-hclog format –"},"655":{"id":"/docs/reference/logging-12","page_id":"/docs/reference/logging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/logging#createloggermodule","content":"<TypeTable\n  type=\"{\n  module: {\n    description: &#x22;Value for the `@module` field. Use dot-separated names for subsystems: `\\&#x22;provider.http_client\\&#x22;`.&#x22;,\n    type: &#x22;string&#x22;,\n    default: '&#x22;provider&#x22;',\n  },\n}\"\n/>"},"656":{"id":"/docs/reference/logging-13","page_id":"/docs/reference/logging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/logging#logger-interface","content":"Extra `fields` are merged at the root of the JSON object alongside the `@`-prefixed fields."},"657":{"id":"/docs/reference/logging-14","page_id":"/docs/reference/logging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/logging#log-levels","content":"<TypeTable\n  type=\"{\n  trace: {\n    description: &#x22;Per-attribute values, raw request/response bodies.&#x22;,\n    type: '&#x22;trace&#x22;',\n  },\n  debug: {\n    description: &#x22;API calls, state transitions, computed diffs.&#x22;,\n    type: '&#x22;debug&#x22;',\n  },\n  info: {\n    description: &#x22;High-level lifecycle events (configured, created, destroyed).&#x22;,\n    type: '&#x22;info&#x22;',\n  },\n  warn: {\n    description: &#x22;Recoverable issues — deprecated config, retried calls.&#x22;,\n    type: '&#x22;warn&#x22;',\n  },\n  error: {\n    description: &#x22;Unexpected internal errors that supplement a `Diagnostic`.&#x22;,\n    type: '&#x22;error&#x22;',\n  },\n}\"\n/>"},"658":{"id":"/docs/reference/logging-15","page_id":"/docs/reference/logging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/logging#environment-variables","content":"Log level is resolved from the environment when `createLogger()` is first called. If neither variable is set, the logger